      "message": "Ok, so I know why the test is failing with the change. That is because the test is broken. We have \"sdkmember\" and \"sdkmember_mysdk_1\" with different apex_availability. The second is available for myapex. The first is not.\n\nSomehow, and I don\u0027t yet understand why, ATM, the apex only checks \"sdkmember_mysdk_1\" to see if it is a member of \"myapex\".\n\nAdding in the logic to filter out the tags stops it from checking availability for \"sdkmember_mysdk_1\" (which is correct) but starts checking availability for \"sdkmember\" which then breaks.",
